hared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3kc7vVRl845AknJtUqGRAg","review_id":"auJK9lQqNiplDqq6DQ-F4w","date":"2017-05-06T20:53:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9602028727531433,"text_excerpt":"This is a great place. Don't let the fact that it is inside a gas station fool you. The chicken shawarma is hands down the best I've ever had. It comes with a nice side salad and hummus, or you can choose fries. The owners are super friendly. I can't wait to try more."},{"business_id":"3kc7vVRl845AknJtUqGRAg","review_id":"SN3Q38BcE6DAeEmUvIo9Tg","date":"2018-04-22T00:46:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9363665580749512,"text_excerpt":"I've had a gyros salad from this place about a year ago and it was really good. However, went back today because I wanted hummus and falafel. Everything was fresh and really flavorful. I had the falafel plate with a side of baba ganouj. I could not eat it all. The portions are pretty big but as I've said before, I don't share food:). I also like that the kitchen is open so you can watch them cook everything right in front of you. Adding to this nice food experience is the staff. They were friendly. I must also inform you that this place is inside of the Jetgo gas station. Don't let that deter you. The food is delicious."},{"business_id":"3kc7vVRl845AknJtUqGRAg","review_id":"ZBOu0qhTJheHdmpjCgaB9Q","date":"2019-04-07T20:37:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9300063848495483,"text_excerpt":"I was in the area and wanted to grab a quick and easy lunch. As I was looking through Yelp, I came across this place on Magazine. It is located in a gas station. Great part about this place is that there is parking inside the gas station so you wouldn't have to worry about street parking. Don't let the title of a restaurant being located in a gas station fool you. The food was excellent. Portions were awesome for the price. I got the combo plate (chicken and gyro) that was served with rice, hummus, salad, and your choice of white or wheat pita. I got the gyro wrap for my dad which is served with either hummus plus salad or fries. Everything is made fresh here. The employees were excellent..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3kc7vVRl845AknJtUqGRAg","photo_id":"Q97gnQcmpssSNuruuT-ElA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Q97gnQcmpssSNuruuT-ElA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.897538959980011},{"business_id":"3kc7vVRl845AknJtUqGRAg","photo_id":"OOaBU5aRAPdeA-5SABcHFg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OOaBU5aRAPdeA-5SABcHFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8956460952758789},{"business_id":"3kc7vVRl845AknJtUqGRAg","photo_id":"FWx6gfjYLSvDa7gnBx_BQQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FWx6gfjYLSvDa7gnBx_BQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8415511846542358},{"business_id":"3kc7vVRl845AknJtUqGRAg","photo_id":"kaMoMYy-2H-erUWt-u97DQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kaMoMYy-2H-erUWt-u97DQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8146070837974548},{"business_id":"3kc7vVRl845AknJtUqGRAg","photo_id":"